<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_evaluacion_supervisor" targetNamespace="https://proserge.com/bpmn">
  <bpmn:process id="Process_evaluaciones_evaluacion_supervisor" name="Evaluacion de supervisor" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>Un residente o administrador autorizado evalua a un supervisor dentro del scope de mina, sin requerir parada. | Evidencia: app/Modules/Evaluaciones/Services/EvaluacionSupervisorService.php; app/Modules/Evaluaciones/Services/EvaluationCandidateService.php; app/Modules/Evaluaciones/Policies/EvaluacionesPolicy.php; tests/Feature/EvaluacionSupervisorApiTest.php; docs/evaluaciones.md | Por confirmar: Relacion laboral exacta que determina que supervisores estan bajo cada residente. | Por confirmar: Permitir varias evaluaciones del mismo supervisor y fecha cuando no hay grupo: actualmente hasDuplicate no lo bloquea.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_evaluacion_supervisor">
    <bpmn:lane id="Lane_Resident" name="Residente o admin autorizado">
      <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_Supervisor</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_Find</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_Score</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_Saved</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_Forbidden</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_Duplicate</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
    </bpmn:lane>
    <bpmn:lane id="Lane_System" name="Sistema">
      <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_Authorize</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gateway_Allowed</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_Calc</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_Duplicate</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Gateway_Duplicate</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
    </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_Supervisor" name="Inicia evaluacion de supervisor">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:userTask id="Task_Find" name="Buscar supervisor y seleccionar mina">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:businessRuleTask id="Task_Authorize" name="Validar permiso, actor y scope">
      <bpmn:documentation>EvaluacionesPolicy::canEvaluateType y canEvaluateSupervisorTarget: permiso y actor residente/override, es_supervisor, scope; si MINA sin grupo acepta relacion minera activa o grupo historico. No prueba subordinacion directa al residente. Fuera de MINA no exige esa relacion; admin override omite relacion, no marca es_supervisor.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_3</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:businessRuleTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gateway_Allowed" name="Puede evaluar?">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_4</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_7</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:userTask id="Task_Score" name="Completar bloques A, B y C">
      <bpmn:documentation>SupervisorEvaluationTemplate: bloques A, B y C separados. StoreEvaluacionSupervisorRequest valida respuestas; identidad no se toma del formulario.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_4</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_5</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Task_Calc" name="Calcular y guardar resultado">
      <bpmn:documentation>EvaluacionSupervisorService::create y SupervisorEvaluationTemplate: normaliza respuestas y calcula resultado; actor desde cuenta autenticada, estado REGISTRADA. Sin personal_id solo isPrivileged. No requiere asistencia o parada.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_DuplicateNo</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_6</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_Saved" name="Supervisor evaluado">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_6</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_Forbidden" name="Acceso denegado">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_7</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:businessRuleTask id="Task_Duplicate" name="Comprobar duplicado si hay grupo">
      <bpmn:documentation>EvaluacionSupervisorService::hasDuplicate: evaluado_id + grupo_trabajo_id + fecha; sin grupo devuelve false.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_5</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_DuplicateCheck</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:businessRuleTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Gateway_Duplicate" name="Duplicado detectado?">
      <bpmn:documentation>EvaluacionSupervisorService::create: EVAL_SUP_DUPLICATED.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_DuplicateCheck</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_DuplicateNo</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_DuplicateYes</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_Duplicate" name="Rechazado: mismo contexto">
      <bpmn:documentation>EvaluacionSupervisorService::hasDuplicate; no se garantiza unicidad sin grupo.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_DuplicateYes</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_1" sourceRef="Start_Supervisor" targetRef="Task_Find"></bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_2" sourceRef="Task_Find" targetRef="Task_Authorize"></bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_3" sourceRef="Task_Authorize" targetRef="Gateway_Allowed"></bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_4" sourceRef="Gateway_Allowed" targetRef="Task_Score" name="Si"></bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_5" sourceRef="Task_Score" targetRef="Task_Duplicate"></bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_6" sourceRef="Task_Calc" targetRef="End_Saved"></bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_7" sourceRef="Gateway_Allowed" targetRef="End_Forbidden" name="No"></bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_DuplicateCheck" sourceRef="Task_Duplicate" targetRef="Gateway_Duplicate"></bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_DuplicateNo" sourceRef="Gateway_Duplicate" targetRef="Task_Calc" name="No / sin grupo"></bpmn:sequenceFlow>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_DuplicateYes" sourceRef="Gateway_Duplicate" targetRef="End_Duplicate" name="Si"></bpmn:sequenceFlow>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_evaluacion_supervisor">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_evaluacion_supervisor" bpmnElement="Process_evaluaciones_evaluacion_supervisor">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_Resident_di" bpmnElement="Lane_Resident" isHorizontal="true">
        <dc:Bounds x="60" y="70" width="1850" height="300" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_System_di" bpmnElement="Lane_System" isHorizontal="true">
        <dc:Bounds x="60" y="370" width="1850" height="300" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Start_Supervisor_di" bpmnElement="Start_Supervisor">
        <dc:Bounds x="215" y="142" width="36" height="36" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_Find_di" bpmnElement="Task_Find">
        <dc:Bounds x="405" y="124" width="150" height="72" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_Authorize_di" bpmnElement="Task_Authorize">
        <dc:Bounds x="595" y="424" width="150" height="72" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Gateway_Allowed_di" bpmnElement="Gateway_Allowed">
        <dc:Bounds x="785" y="435" width="50" height="50" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_Score_di" bpmnElement="Task_Score">
        <dc:Bounds x="975" y="124" width="150" height="72" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_Calc_di" bpmnElement="Task_Calc">
        <dc:Bounds x="1545" y="424" width="150" height="72" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_Saved_di" bpmnElement="End_Saved">
        <dc:Bounds x="1735" y="142" width="36" height="36" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_Forbidden_di" bpmnElement="End_Forbidden">
        <dc:Bounds x="975" y="262" width="36" height="36" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_Duplicate_di" bpmnElement="Task_Duplicate">
        <dc:Bounds x="1165" y="424" width="150" height="72" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Gateway_Duplicate_di" bpmnElement="Gateway_Duplicate">
        <dc:Bounds x="1355" y="435" width="50" height="50" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_Duplicate_di" bpmnElement="End_Duplicate">
        <dc:Bounds x="1545" y="142" width="36" height="36" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_1_di" bpmnElement="Flow_1">
        <di:waypoint x="251" y="160" />
        <di:waypoint x="328" y="160" />
        <di:waypoint x="328" y="160" />
        <di:waypoint x="405" y="160" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_2_di" bpmnElement="Flow_2">
        <di:waypoint x="555" y="160" />
        <di:waypoint x="575" y="160" />
        <di:waypoint x="575" y="460" />
        <di:waypoint x="595" y="460" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_3_di" bpmnElement="Flow_3">
        <di:waypoint x="745" y="460" />
        <di:waypoint x="765" y="460" />
        <di:waypoint x="765" y="460" />
        <di:waypoint x="785" y="460" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_4_di" bpmnElement="Flow_4">
        <di:waypoint x="835" y="460" />
        <di:waypoint x="905" y="460" />
        <di:waypoint x="905" y="160" />
        <di:waypoint x="975" y="160" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_5_di" bpmnElement="Flow_5">
        <di:waypoint x="1125" y="160" />
        <di:waypoint x="1145" y="160" />
        <di:waypoint x="1145" y="460" />
        <di:waypoint x="1165" y="460" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_6_di" bpmnElement="Flow_6">
        <di:waypoint x="1695" y="460" />
        <di:waypoint x="1715" y="460" />
        <di:waypoint x="1715" y="160" />
        <di:waypoint x="1735" y="160" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_7_di" bpmnElement="Flow_7">
        <di:waypoint x="835" y="460" />
        <di:waypoint x="905" y="460" />
        <di:waypoint x="905" y="280" />
        <di:waypoint x="975" y="280" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_DuplicateCheck_di" bpmnElement="Flow_DuplicateCheck">
        <di:waypoint x="1315" y="460" />
        <di:waypoint x="1335" y="460" />
        <di:waypoint x="1335" y="460" />
        <di:waypoint x="1355" y="460" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_DuplicateNo_di" bpmnElement="Flow_DuplicateNo">
        <di:waypoint x="1405" y="460" />
        <di:waypoint x="1475" y="460" />
        <di:waypoint x="1475" y="460" />
        <di:waypoint x="1545" y="460" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_DuplicateYes_di" bpmnElement="Flow_DuplicateYes">
        <di:waypoint x="1405" y="460" />
        <di:waypoint x="1475" y="460" />
        <di:waypoint x="1475" y="160" />
        <di:waypoint x="1545" y="160" />
      </bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
